{"message":"I can’t identify the exact source of the 1,716-point difference from the available transaction history. The account lookup shows the current Gold Card balance of 7,021 points, while the 23 transactions reviewed total 5,305 points; it does not provide a separate rewards-ledger history showing prior balances, redemptions, returns, or manual adjustments.

The difference is therefore not attributable to any transaction currently listed. It may represent rewards earned before the available transaction period, but I can’t confirm that or identify a specific adjustment without the relevant rewards statement or ledger detail. No account adjustment is shown in the data I can access.

When you have access to your statement, the useful entries to check are the prior rewards balance, rewards earned, redemptions, and adjustments or reversals. Providing the statement period or those line items will let me reconcile the 1,716 points precisely."}
